WEBVTT

00:07.738 --> 00:09.174
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.261 --> 00:10.695
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.782 --> 00:12.391
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.478 --> 00:14.217
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.304 --> 00:17.478
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.564 --> 00:19.243
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.304 --> 00:21.608
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.695 --> 00:23.391
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.478 --> 00:25.304
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.391 --> 00:27.269
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.348 --> 00:29.651
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.738 --> 00:31.584
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.608 --> 00:33.217
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.304 --> 00:34.956
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.043 --> 00:37.391
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.478 --> 00:39.304
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.391 --> 00:40.695
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.782 --> 00:42.521
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.608 --> 00:45.217
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.304 --> 00:47.521
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.608 --> 00:48.825
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.478 --> 00:53.348
[jaunty island music]
[欢快的岛屿音乐]

00:53.435 --> 00:59.695
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.782 --> 01:02.695
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

01:02.782 --> 01:05.521
- Jetsam City, here I come!
- 杰萨姆城，我来了！

01:05.608 --> 01:09.130
This is going to be
the best weekend ever!
这将是
有史以来最好的周末！

01:09.217 --> 01:10.651
[groans] Huh?
[呻吟]啊？

01:10.738 --> 01:12.738
- Squidward.
- 章鱼哥。

01:12.825 --> 01:14.435
- Bubble Bass.
- 泡泡鲈鱼。

01:14.521 --> 01:16.043
- Don't tell me you're going
- 别告诉我你要走了

01:16.130 --> 01:18.521
to the Jetsam City
comic convention too.
前往杰萨姆城
漫画大会也是如此。

01:18.608 --> 01:20.174
- Oh, why would I waste my time
-哦，我为什么要浪费时间

01:20.261 --> 01:23.130
on an idiotic comic book
convention?
在一本愚蠢的漫画书上
公约？

01:23.217 --> 01:25.956
I am a man of sophistication.
我是一个老练的人。

01:26.043 --> 01:28.651
I'm going to the
clarinet convention.
我要去
单簧管公约。

01:28.738 --> 01:30.000
- Oh, please!
- 哦，拜托！

01:30.086 --> 01:31.651
Talk about a waste of time.
谈论浪费时间。

01:31.738 --> 01:33.912
- [growls] Shows what you know.
- [咆哮]展示你所知道的。

01:34.000 --> 01:36.261
The lecture on the history
of spit valves
历史讲座
吐出阀数

01:36.348 --> 01:39.391
is worth the price
of admission alone.
值得这个价钱
单独入场。

01:39.478 --> 01:41.782
- When I said talk
about a waste of time,
- 当我说说话时
关于浪费时间，

01:41.869 --> 01:44.087
I didn't mean literally.
我不是字面意思。

01:44.173 --> 01:45.564
- Hmph!
——哼！

01:45.651 --> 01:49.435
- All aboard for the train
to Jetsam City!
- 全部上车
前往杰萨姆城！

01:49.521 --> 01:51.478
- Just stay away from me.
- 离我远一点。

01:51.564 --> 01:53.564
- Dit to the O.
- 对 O 说。

01:53.651 --> 01:55.651
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

01:55.738 --> 01:57.521
[all clamoring]
[全都吵闹]

01:57.608 --> 02:00.825
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:00.912 --> 02:02.869
[groans]
Huh?
[呻吟]
啊？

02:05.348 --> 02:06.695
Typical.
典型的。

02:06.782 --> 02:08.303
Hmm...
- Dibs!
嗯...
- 迪布斯！

02:08.391 --> 02:10.608
- [grumbles] Oh.
- [抱怨]哦。

02:10.695 --> 02:12.435
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:12.521 --> 02:14.651
- Keep walking, Bucko!
- 继续走，巴科！

02:14.738 --> 02:16.695
- Oh, come on!
- 哦，来吧！

02:17.738 --> 02:18.956
Oh!
哦！

02:20.738 --> 02:22.782
Oh, you!
哦，你！

02:22.869 --> 02:24.869
You're taking up two seats!
你占了两个座位！

02:24.956 --> 02:27.304
- One for each cheek.
- 每脸颊各一个。

02:27.391 --> 02:28.869
- Just move over!
- 走过去吧！

02:28.956 --> 02:30.348
It's the last seat on the train.
这是火车上的最后一个座位。

02:30.435 --> 02:32.304
- Oh, fine.
- 哦，好吧。

02:35.130 --> 02:36.478
- And don't talk to me.
- 别跟我说话。

02:36.564 --> 02:38.564
- Mmm!
- 嗯！

02:38.651 --> 02:41.217
[slurping noisily]
[大声吸吮]

02:42.825 --> 02:45.608
- [groans] It's finished!
- [呻吟]结束了！

02:45.695 --> 02:47.348
- Hmph.
- 哼。

02:47.435 --> 02:49.695
Then it appears
I need another snack.
然后出现
我还需要一份零食。

02:49.782 --> 02:50.956
Huh?
啊？

02:51.043 --> 02:53.000
[squeals]
The fondue cart!
[尖叫声]
火锅车！

02:53.087 --> 02:54.478
- [yelps]
- The fondue cart!
- [尖叫声]
- 火锅车！

02:54.564 --> 02:56.478
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:56.564 --> 02:58.130
- Fondue, sir?
- 火锅，先生？

02:58.217 --> 03:01.738
- One bubbling bowl
of melted cheese, please.
- 一个冒泡的碗
请给我一些融化的奶酪。

03:01.825 --> 03:03.130
- You're in luck, sir.
- 你很幸运，先生。

03:03.217 --> 03:05.956
I just made a fresh,
piping hot batch!
我刚做了一个新鲜的，
滚烫的一批！

03:06.043 --> 03:07.391
What size would you like?
您想要什么尺寸？

03:07.478 --> 03:10.869
- Oh, I brought
my own fondue pot.
- 哦，我带来了
我自己的火锅锅。

03:10.956 --> 03:12.261
Fill it to the rim.
将其填充至边缘。

03:12.348 --> 03:13.695
- Yes, sir.
- 是的，先生。

03:13.782 --> 03:16.000
- Uh, hey, hey.
Be-be-be careful with that!
- 呃，嘿，嘿。
小心一点！

03:16.087 --> 03:19.782
- Next stop, Jetsam City!
- 下一站，杰萨姆城！

03:19.869 --> 03:21.782
- [screams] Hot!
- [尖叫] 热！

03:25.087 --> 03:27.043
- Are you going to eat that?
- 你要吃那个吗？

03:27.130 --> 03:29.608
[slobbers noisily]
[大声流口水]

03:29.695 --> 03:30.825
- Get off of me!
- 放开我！

03:32.478 --> 03:33.912
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

03:34.000 --> 03:36.956
- [groans] Hmph!
- [呻吟]哼！

03:38.782 --> 03:40.738
[groans]
Stay on your side!
[呻吟]
留在你身边！

03:40.825 --> 03:42.521
[growls]
[咆哮]

03:42.608 --> 03:45.738
- Well, aren't you two
the best of friends!
- 好吧，你们两个不是吗？
最好的朋友！

03:45.825 --> 03:46.738
- We are not!
- 我们不是！

03:46.825 --> 03:48.737
Now, what do you want?
现在，你想要什么？

03:48.825 --> 03:51.391
- Would you watch my baby
while I run to the restroom?
- 你会看管我的宝贝吗
当我跑去洗手间的时候？

03:51.478 --> 03:54.608
I have to powder my nose
like a racehorse!
我得搽鼻粉
像赛马一样！

03:54.695 --> 03:55.956
Thanks!
谢谢！

03:56.043 --> 03:58.174
- [snores]
- [babbles]
- [打鼾]
- [胡言乱语]

03:58.261 --> 04:00.261
- Ah!
- 啊！

04:00.348 --> 04:03.521
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

04:03.608 --> 04:06.608
- This is what I get
for traveling coach.
- 这就是我得到的
对于旅行教练。

04:06.695 --> 04:07.956
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

04:10.391 --> 04:14.738
That fondue gave me
the cheese sweats.
那火锅给了我
奶酪会出汗。

04:14.825 --> 04:18.912
Oh! Refreshing.
哦！令人耳目一新。

04:19.000 --> 04:20.199
- You're making the baby cold!
- 你让宝宝着凉了！

04:20.261 --> 04:22.478
- [babbles]
- What?
- [胡言乱语]
- 什么？

04:22.564 --> 04:26.261
Where did you get
such an adorable baby?
你从哪里得到的
这么可爱的宝宝？

04:26.348 --> 04:28.956
Who clearly wants
the window open.
谁明确想要
窗户打开了。

04:29.043 --> 04:31.130
- Oh!
- Huh?
- 哦！
- 啊？

04:31.217 --> 04:33.261
- The baby wants it closed!
- 宝宝想要把它关上！

04:33.348 --> 04:34.956
- The baby wants it open!
- 宝宝想要打开它！

04:35.043 --> 04:36.217
- [babbles]
- Closed!
- [胡言乱语]
- 关门了！

04:36.304 --> 04:37.435
- Open!
- Closed!
- 打开！
- 关门了！

04:37.521 --> 04:38.738
- Open!
- 打开！

04:38.825 --> 04:42.956
Both:
Huh? The baby!
两者：
啊？宝贝！

04:43.043 --> 04:44.999
- I'm back!
- 我回来了！

04:45.087 --> 04:47.782
Hey. Where's my baby?
嘿。我的宝贝在哪里？

04:47.869 --> 04:50.608
- You really want to know?
- 你真的想知道吗？

04:50.695 --> 04:52.087
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:52.174 --> 04:54.130
- I hope she finds her baby.
- 我希望她找到她的孩子。

04:54.217 --> 04:56.478
- Tickets! Tickets!
- 门票！门票！

04:56.564 --> 04:58.825
Tickets?
门票？

04:58.912 --> 04:59.825
[both chuckle]
[两人都笑了]

04:59.912 --> 05:02.825
No tickets, huh?
没有门票吧？

05:02.912 --> 05:06.130
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

05:07.782 --> 05:09.912
- I loathe you.
- 我讨厌你。

05:10.000 --> 05:11.738
- Don't you worry, baby.
- 别担心，宝贝。

05:11.825 --> 05:15.478
When Mommy finds those two,
she's gonna ground them.
当妈妈找到那两个人时
她会把他们禁足的。

05:15.564 --> 05:17.521
Into dust!
化为尘埃！

05:20.087 --> 05:21.608
- I'm walking.
- 我正在走路。

05:21.695 --> 05:22.956
- Without snacks?
- 没有零食吗？

05:23.043 --> 05:24.564
I'm going to get hungry.
我要饿了。

05:24.651 --> 05:27.043
You won't like me
when I'm hungry!
你不会喜欢我的
当我饿的时候！

05:27.130 --> 05:29.261
- I don't like you now!
- 我现在不喜欢你了！

05:29.348 --> 05:33.564
[bleak mellow music]
[凄凉柔和的音乐]

05:33.651 --> 05:36.087
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

05:36.174 --> 05:39.087
We're going to die out here!
我们会死在这里的！

05:39.174 --> 05:41.869
[sobbing]
[bell ringing]
[抽泣]
[铃声响起]

05:41.956 --> 05:44.087
- Huh? Maybe not. Look!
- 啊？也许不是。看！

05:44.174 --> 05:46.695
♪ Old Man Jenkins has a farm ♪
♪ 詹金斯老人有一个农场 ♪

05:46.782 --> 05:50.043
- ♪ And on that farm,
he has a ride? ♪
- ♪ 在那个农场里，
他有车吗？ ♪

05:50.130 --> 05:53.087
Both:
♪ E-I-E-I-O! ♪
两者：
♪ 诶-我-我-我-欧！ ♪

05:53.174 --> 05:54.435
- ♪ With a tractor here! ♪
- ♪ 这里有拖拉机！ ♪

05:54.521 --> 05:56.043
- ♪ And some horsies there! ♪
- ♪ 那里还有一些马！ ♪

05:56.130 --> 05:57.825
- ♪ Here a boat! ♪
- ♪ There a bike! ♪
- ♪ 这里有一艘船！ ♪
- ♪ 有一辆自行车！ ♪

05:57.912 --> 05:59.521
- ♪ Everywhere
are boots to hike! ♪
- ♪ 无处不在
是徒步旅行的靴子！ ♪

05:59.608 --> 06:02.087
- ♪ Old Man Jenkins
has a plane ♪
- ♪ 老詹金斯
有飞机♪

06:02.174 --> 06:03.564
- ♪ E-I-E-I ♪
- ♪ 伊-伊-伊-我 ♪

06:03.651 --> 06:05.521
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

06:05.608 --> 06:07.869
Quit it.
戒掉吧。

06:07.956 --> 06:10.782
[airplane whirring]
[飞机呼呼]

06:10.869 --> 06:13.130
- Thanks for the ride!
- 感谢您的搭车！

06:13.217 --> 06:16.000
- And the egg salad sandwiches.
- 还有鸡蛋沙拉三明治。

06:16.087 --> 06:17.825
- You folks are lucky!
- 你们真幸运！

06:17.912 --> 06:19.391
I was just heading into the city
我刚刚进城

06:19.478 --> 06:21.564
to pick up the new
Farmer's Almanac!
拿起新的
农民年鉴！

06:21.651 --> 06:24.261
- To celebrate, I think
I will have another one
- 我想是为了庆祝
我再要一份

06:24.348 --> 06:26.174
of those sandwiches.
那些三明治。

06:26.261 --> 06:28.391
- Whoa! You just ate!
- 哇！你刚吃过饭！

06:28.478 --> 06:30.478
- I can almost reach.
- 我几乎可以到达。

06:30.564 --> 06:32.000
- Whoa!
- 哇！

06:32.087 --> 06:33.782
- Stop shaking the plane
- 停止摇晃飞机

06:33.869 --> 06:35.695
or I'll pull this thing
right over!
或者我会拉这个东西
结束了！

06:35.782 --> 06:37.130
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:37.217 --> 06:39.043
- Thank you. Much better.
- 谢谢。好多了。

06:41.000 --> 06:42.217
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

06:44.303 --> 06:46.738
- Now what do we do?
- 现在我们该怎么办？

06:46.825 --> 06:50.521
- You could pull me using
the plane tail as a rickshaw.
- 你可以用
飞机尾部像人力车。

06:50.608 --> 06:53.174
- Me pull you?
This is your fault!
- 我拉你吗？
这是你的错！

06:53.261 --> 06:54.260
You should pull me!
你应该拉我！

06:54.304 --> 06:55.912
- We'll flip a coin.
- 我们来抛一枚硬币。

06:56.000 --> 06:58.478
- You're on!
- 你来了！

06:58.564 --> 06:59.738
- Hmm?
- 唔？

06:59.825 --> 07:01.130
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:01.217 --> 07:02.304
I can't reach.
我够不到。

07:02.391 --> 07:04.130
Could you fish it out?
你能把它捞出来吗？

07:04.217 --> 07:06.217
- [groans] You win.
- [呻吟]你赢了。

07:09.043 --> 07:10.217
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

07:11.651 --> 07:15.782
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:15.869 --> 07:18.651
[gloomy music]
[阴沉的音乐]

07:18.738 --> 07:21.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:21.087 --> 07:24.174
Don't scratch the paint.
不要刮伤油漆。

07:24.261 --> 07:26.738
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

07:26.825 --> 07:28.130
Keep the change.
留着零钱吧。

07:29.304 --> 07:30.869
[jaunty music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:30.956 --> 07:32.564
[bell dinging]
[铃声]

07:32.651 --> 07:34.695
- Yes?
- 是的？

07:34.782 --> 07:37.391
- Reservation
for Squidward Tentacles.
- 预订
对于章鱼哥触手。

07:37.478 --> 07:39.217
- And Bubble Bass.
- 还有泡泡鲈鱼。

07:39.304 --> 07:41.391
- Mr. Tentacles and Mr. Bass.
- 触手先生和巴斯先生。

07:41.478 --> 07:43.391
Ooh!
哦！

07:43.478 --> 07:46.912
You two have reserved
our finest rooms.
你们两个已经预约了
我们最好的房间。

07:47.000 --> 07:48.956
- Can we just get our keys?
- 我们能拿到钥匙吗？

07:49.043 --> 07:51.043
- Mm, no.
- 嗯，不。

07:51.130 --> 07:53.304
You were supposed to
check in yesterday.
你本来应该
昨天入住。

07:53.391 --> 07:55.000
But you didn't.
但你没有。

07:55.087 --> 07:57.130
So we gave your rooms away.
所以我们把你的房间给了。

07:57.217 --> 08:00.130
[both sobbing]
[两人都抽泣]

08:03.651 --> 08:07.478
[groans]
Let me see what we can do.
[呻吟]
让我看看我们能做什么。

08:07.564 --> 08:09.391
Oh! Here we go.
哦！开始了。

08:09.478 --> 08:12.391
Though it's not as nice as
your previous accommodations.
虽然它不如
您以前的住宿。

08:12.478 --> 08:15.391
- [sniffles]
- It's just for one night.
- [抽鼻子]
- 只住一晚。

08:15.478 --> 08:17.261
How bad can it be?
有多糟糕？

08:20.130 --> 08:23.782
Say, this isn't so bad.
说吧，这还不算太糟糕。

08:23.869 --> 08:25.608
- The shower's all yours.
- 淋浴间都是你的了。

08:25.695 --> 08:28.738
- [groans] I'm tired.
I'm just going to sleep.
- [呻吟]我累了。
我要睡觉了。

08:28.825 --> 08:30.869
- As you wish.
- 如你所愿。

08:30.956 --> 08:33.000
Ah!
- [grunts]
啊!
- [咕哝]

08:33.087 --> 08:34.650
- Hey, keep to your side.
- 嘿，留在你身边。

08:34.738 --> 08:36.216
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

08:37.521 --> 08:39.956
[crunching]
Huh?
[嘎吱嘎吱]
啊？

08:40.043 --> 08:42.869
Oh, you're getting crumbs
in the bed!
哦，你得到了面包屑
在床上！

08:42.956 --> 08:45.000
I'm going to sleep
in the bathroom.
我要睡觉了
在浴室里。

08:45.087 --> 08:46.000
Hmph!
哼！

08:46.087 --> 08:48.043
- Suit yourself.
- 适合你自己。

08:48.130 --> 08:49.435
- What?
- 什么？

08:51.000 --> 08:54.087
Of course he destroyed
the bathroom.
他当然毁掉了
浴室。

08:54.174 --> 08:56.391
But hey, this is fancy.
但是嘿，这太奇特了。

08:56.478 --> 08:58.478
Shag carpeting!
粗毛地毯！

08:58.564 --> 09:00.956
- ♪ That's not carpet ♪
- ♪ 那不是地毯 ♪

09:01.043 --> 09:02.956
[shrieking]
[尖叫]

09:03.043 --> 09:08.261
- Is this your body hair?
- 这是你的体毛吗？

09:08.348 --> 09:10.695
What is wrong with you?
你怎么了？

09:10.782 --> 09:12.391
The horror.
恐怖。

09:12.478 --> 09:14.217
The horror.
恐怖。

09:14.304 --> 09:18.869
[gloomy music]
[阴沉的音乐]

09:18.956 --> 09:20.695
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

09:23.087 --> 09:25.651
- Well, you look chipper.
- 嗯，你看起来精神抖擞。

09:25.738 --> 09:28.000
Did you sleep well?
- Nope!
你睡的好吗？
- 没有！

09:28.087 --> 09:31.521
But soon you'll be
at your lame comic convention,
但很快你就会
在你蹩脚的漫画大会上，

09:31.608 --> 09:33.738
far away from me!
离我远点！

09:33.825 --> 09:35.825
That is something
to smile about.
那是某事
微笑着。

09:35.912 --> 09:37.956
- Agreed.
- 同意。

09:38.043 --> 09:41.564
But your Clarinet Con is,
by far, the lamer of the two.
但你的单簧管演奏会是，
到目前为止，两者中较弱的一个。

09:41.651 --> 09:42.695
- Yay!
- 耶！

09:42.782 --> 09:44.391
Comic books!
漫画书！

09:44.478 --> 09:46.130
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:46.217 --> 09:48.348
- Well, at least we clarinetists
- 好吧，至少我们单簧管演奏家

09:48.435 --> 09:50.651
don't wear stupid capes.
不要穿愚蠢的斗篷。

09:50.738 --> 09:52.478
[jaunty clarinet melody]
[欢快的单簧管旋律]

09:52.564 --> 09:53.695
- [grunts, groans]
- [咕哝声，呻吟声]

09:53.782 --> 09:55.478
- You were saying?
- 你是说？

09:58.391 --> 10:00.174
Yoo-hoo-hoo!
- [laughs]
哟呼呼！
- [笑]

10:00.261 --> 10:01.825
Whoa!
哇！

10:01.912 --> 10:03.956
- Whoa!
- 哇！

10:04.043 --> 10:04.869
- Is that...
[airplane whirring]
- 那是...
[飞机呼呼]

10:04.956 --> 10:06.869
Old Man Jenkins?
老詹金斯？

10:06.956 --> 10:11.043
- Gadzooks!
- 小玩意儿！

10:11.130 --> 10:12.912
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

10:13.000 --> 10:14.454
- No, no, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no, no, no!
- 不，不，不，不，不，不，
不，不，不，不，不，不，不！

10:14.478 --> 10:18.217
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:18.304 --> 10:20.000
- No, no, no, no, no, no!
- 不，不，不，不，不，不！

10:20.087 --> 10:23.043
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:23.130 --> 10:26.130
[jaunty music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:26.217 --> 10:28.695
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:28.782 --> 10:32.825
Any landing you can walk
away from is a good landing!
您可以步行的任何着陆点
远离是很好的登陆！

10:35.043 --> 10:36.261
[people scream]
[人们尖叫]

10:39.391 --> 10:41.521
- No!
- 不！

10:41.608 --> 10:44.391
All those innocent
comic books, lost!
所有那些无辜的人
漫画，丢了！

10:44.478 --> 10:47.000
- Ha! In your face!
- 哈！当着你的面！

10:47.087 --> 10:49.304
I still get to go
to my clarinet convention,
我还是得走了
参加我的单簧管大会，

10:49.391 --> 10:51.348
and you get nothing!
而你什么也得不到！

10:51.435 --> 10:52.956
You lose!
你输了！

10:53.043 --> 10:54.912
[laughs]
[笑]

10:58.043 --> 11:01.000
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

11:01.087 --> 11:02.695
- Of course.
- 当然。

11:02.782 --> 11:04.651
- Worst. Trip.
- 最糟糕的。旅行。

11:04.738 --> 11:06.478
- Ever!
- 曾经！

11:06.564 --> 11:08.912
Hey, where did everybody go?
嘿，大家都去哪儿了？

11:10.695 --> 11:11.956
[train horn blaring]
[火车喇叭鸣响]

11:12.043 --> 11:14.738
both:
The train station!
两者：
火车站！

11:14.825 --> 11:18.695
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

11:18.782 --> 11:22.435
- No tickets, no ride.
- 没有门票，不能乘车。

11:22.521 --> 11:23.956
Both:
Huh?
两者：
啊？

11:24.043 --> 11:27.912
- You boys owe me half a plane!
- 你们孩子们欠我半架飞机！

11:29.478 --> 11:31.782
- Typical.
- 典型的。

11:31.869 --> 11:33.695
[groans]
- Slow down!
[呻吟]
- 慢点！

11:33.782 --> 11:35.564
You're hurting my arms!
你弄疼我的胳膊了！

11:35.651 --> 11:37.261
- There they are, Junior!
Both: Huh?
- 他们在那里，少年！
两人：啊？

11:37.348 --> 11:38.782
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

11:38.869 --> 11:40.869
- After 'em!
- 追随他们！

11:40.956 --> 11:43.651
Both:
I loathe you, chum!
两者：
我讨厌你，伙计！

11:43.738 --> 11:44.651
[growl]
[咆哮]

11:44.738 --> 11:45.956
[scream]
[尖叫]

11:50.478 --> 11:53.348
[jaunty island music]
[欢快的岛屿音乐]

11:53.435 --> 12:00.521
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:00.608 --> 12:04.087
- I have put off cleaning
my attic for way too long.
- 我推迟了清洁工作
我的阁楼已经呆得太久了。

12:07.043 --> 12:09.130
[gasps]
Aww!
[喘气]
哇！

12:09.217 --> 12:11.043
Gary's baby shell!
加里的婴儿壳！

12:11.130 --> 12:13.521
They grow up so fast.
他们长得真快。

12:19.304 --> 12:21.564
[groaning]
[呻吟]

12:23.956 --> 12:24.956
Hey!
嘿！

12:25.043 --> 12:27.738
My imagination box!
我的想象力盒子！

12:27.825 --> 12:29.869
I wonder if it still works.
我想知道它是否仍然有效。

12:34.043 --> 12:36.348
Oh, boy, it's time for...
噢，孩子，是时候...

12:36.435 --> 12:40.564
imagination!
想像力！

12:40.651 --> 12:42.521
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

12:42.608 --> 12:44.912
Whee-hee!
嘿嘿！

12:45.000 --> 12:47.435
[engine grinding]
[发动机磨削]

12:49.520 --> 12:50.564
That's weird.
这很奇怪。

12:50.651 --> 12:52.130
- Hey, neighbor.
- 嘿，邻居。

12:52.217 --> 12:54.043
Can I borrow a cup of sand?
我可以借一杯沙子吗？

12:54.130 --> 12:55.435
I'm all out.
我已经全部出局了

12:55.521 --> 12:57.130
Huh?
啊？

12:57.217 --> 12:59.130
Hey!
Isn't that the...?
嘿！
这不是那个……吗？

12:59.217 --> 13:01.608
- It is!
But it won't start.
- 这是！
但它不会开始。

13:01.695 --> 13:03.174
- Oh.
- 哦。

13:03.261 --> 13:05.174
Let me see
if I can get it going.
让我看看
如果我能做到的话。

13:07.956 --> 13:11.087
[engine grinding]
[发动机磨削]

13:11.174 --> 13:12.869
[wheezing]
[喘息]

13:12.956 --> 13:14.608
- We need a professional.
- 我们需要一个专业人士。

13:19.000 --> 13:22.912
Imagination Box Repair.
想象力盒子修复。

13:23.000 --> 13:24.043
This is the place!
就是这个地方！

13:28.261 --> 13:29.260
- Ooh!
- 哦！

13:31.564 --> 13:33.608
Aha!
啊哈！

13:33.695 --> 13:35.564
Ooh.
哦。

13:37.043 --> 13:38.782
Welcome!
欢迎！

13:38.869 --> 13:40.304
[fireworks bursting]
[烟花爆竹]

13:40.391 --> 13:43.825
Wow, a double corrugated 3600.
哇，双瓦楞3600。

13:43.912 --> 13:47.304
I haven't seen one
of these in 25 years.
我还没见过一个
25 年内。

13:47.391 --> 13:49.261
What seems to be the problem?
似乎有什么问题？

13:49.348 --> 13:53.000
- Well, the inspiration motor
won't turn over.
- 嗯，灵感马达
不会翻身。

13:53.087 --> 13:54.825
Dern thing's on the fritz.
Dern 的事情很麻烦。

13:54.912 --> 13:58.130
- Yeah. And it doesn't work.
- 是的。但这不起作用。

13:58.217 --> 13:59.608
- Hmm.
- 唔。

13:59.695 --> 14:01.608
Let me take a look
under the flap.
让我看看
在皮瓣下。

14:04.695 --> 14:06.521
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:06.608 --> 14:10.043
[metallic clanking]
[金属叮当声]

14:10.130 --> 14:12.087
[gurgles]
[咯咯声]

14:12.174 --> 14:13.912
Well, there's your problem.
嗯，这就是你的问题。

14:14.000 --> 14:16.651
Your box has blown
a whimsy gasket.
你的盒子炸了
一个异想天开的垫圈。

14:16.738 --> 14:19.391
They don't make those anymore!
他们不再做那些了！

14:19.478 --> 14:24.174
But I could give you
a great deal on a cushion fort.
但我可以给你
坐垫堡垒上有很多东西。

14:24.261 --> 14:26.130
- No, that's okay.
- 不，没关系。

14:26.217 --> 14:27.825
I'm a cardboard man.
我是一个纸板人。

14:32.391 --> 14:38.000
- Aw, this dumb ol' box
is just junk now.
- 噢，这个愚蠢的盒子
现在只是垃圾。

14:38.087 --> 14:40.564
- Hey! Get off my sand!
- 嘿！离开我的沙子！

14:40.651 --> 14:42.217
[grumbles] Whoa!
[抱怨]哇！

14:42.304 --> 14:44.174
[thumping, yelling]
[重击，大喊]

14:44.261 --> 14:45.521
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

14:45.608 --> 14:46.869
Where am I?
我在哪里？

14:46.956 --> 14:49.695
- Inside my imagination box.
- 在我的想象力盒子里。

14:49.782 --> 14:52.174
- Where'd he go?
- 他去哪儿了？

14:52.261 --> 14:54.304
- You must have jostled
something and fixed it.
- 你一定是撞到了
某事并修复它。

14:54.391 --> 14:55.608
[gasps]
[喘气]

14:55.695 --> 14:57.869
Patrick!
Squidward must be lost!
帕特里克！
章鱼哥一定会迷失的！

14:57.956 --> 14:59.217
- Lost in his own...
- 迷失在自己的...

14:59.304 --> 15:03.130
both:
Imagination!
两者：
想象力！

15:04.825 --> 15:07.695
- [groans] I can't
see a thing in here!
- [呻吟]我不能
看到这里有东西！

15:07.782 --> 15:09.304
I need a flashlight!
我需要一个手电筒！

15:09.391 --> 15:11.435
- Just imagine a flashlight.
- 想象一下手电筒。

15:11.521 --> 15:13.130
- Oh, yeah, right.
- 哦，是的，对。

15:13.217 --> 15:16.174
I'll just imagine it
and it'll appear!
我只会想象一下
它就会出现！

15:16.261 --> 15:17.521
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

15:17.608 --> 15:18.607
What the...
什么...

15:18.651 --> 15:20.695
oh, it worked.
哦，成功了。

15:20.782 --> 15:22.521
Now, where's the way
out of here?
现在，路在哪里
离开这里？

15:22.608 --> 15:24.478
Ooh! I'm leaving!
哦！我要走了！

15:24.564 --> 15:27.738
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:30.956 --> 15:32.869
Huh?
啊？

15:32.956 --> 15:35.956
[screaming]
[尖叫]

15:39.217 --> 15:42.608
How do I get out
of this crazy place?
我怎样才能出去
这个疯狂的地方？

15:42.695 --> 15:44.348
- That's easy, Squidward.
- 这很简单，章鱼哥。

15:44.435 --> 15:46.651
Just visualize
where you'd rather be!
只是想象一下
你想去的地方！

15:46.738 --> 15:49.564
- I'd rather be
far away from you!
- 我宁愿是
离你远点！

15:49.651 --> 15:53.261
Like at a fancy beach resort.
就像在一个豪华的海滩度假村。

15:53.348 --> 15:55.782
[mellow island music]
【柔和的岛屿音乐】

15:55.869 --> 15:57.087
[gasps]
[喘气]

15:57.174 --> 16:00.391
And relaxing on a lounge chair.
并在躺椅上放松。

16:00.478 --> 16:01.521
Ooh!
哦！

16:03.521 --> 16:06.261
Ahh, sipping a tropical drink.
啊，喝着热带饮料。

16:08.869 --> 16:10.695
Ahh.
啊。

16:10.782 --> 16:14.651
Maybe this imagination thing
isn't so bad after all.
或许这就是想象力
毕竟没那么糟糕。

16:14.738 --> 16:16.087
- What are you doing now?
- 你在干什么？

16:16.174 --> 16:18.912
- Well, if you must know,
I'm relaxing
- 好吧，如果你一定要知道的话，
我很放松

16:19.000 --> 16:23.348
under an umbrella surrounded
by beautiful tropical plants.
被包围的伞下
由美丽的热带植物组成。

16:23.435 --> 16:25.435
- Sounds like
you're in a jungle.
- 听起来像
你在丛林里。

16:25.521 --> 16:26.651
- No!
- 不！

16:26.738 --> 16:28.738
It's not a... jungle?
这不是……丛林？

16:28.825 --> 16:31.825
- [shrieks, grumbles]
- [尖叫，抱怨]

16:31.912 --> 16:34.217
- Aren't jungles full
of dangerous animals?
- 丛林不是满了吗
危险的动物？

16:34.304 --> 16:37.130
- Yep!
Like scary sea snakes!
- 是的！
就像可怕的海蛇一样！

16:37.217 --> 16:38.912
- Huh?
- 啊？

16:39.000 --> 16:41.304
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

16:41.391 --> 16:43.304
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

16:43.391 --> 16:46.435
- [hissing]
- [嘶嘶声]

16:47.651 --> 16:49.391
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

16:49.478 --> 16:51.869
Hey! You gotta help me!
嘿！你得帮帮我！

16:51.956 --> 16:53.782
- Oh, and look out
for sea panthers.
-哦，小心
对于海豹来说。

16:53.869 --> 16:55.521
- [growls, roars]
- [咆哮，咆哮]

16:55.608 --> 16:58.521
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

16:58.608 --> 17:02.130
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

17:02.217 --> 17:04.043
- [growls]
- [hisses]
- [咆哮]
- [嘶嘶声]

17:05.912 --> 17:08.174
- How's it going
in there, Squidward?
- 怎么样
在那里，章鱼哥？

17:08.261 --> 17:10.434
- You're making
everything worse!
- 你正在做
一切都更糟！

17:10.520 --> 17:12.173
Would you two clam up?
你们两个能闭嘴吗？

17:12.260 --> 17:15.261
- Oh, I forgot to mention
the clothes-eating clams.
-哦，我忘记说了
吃衣服的蛤

17:15.348 --> 17:17.738
- [chomps]
- [screams] Giant clam!
- [咀嚼]
- [尖叫] 巨蛤！

17:17.825 --> 17:20.520
[screams]
Let go! Ow! Ouch!
[尖叫声]
放开！噢！哎哟!

17:20.607 --> 17:22.435
Hey, that's my shirt!
嘿，那是我的衬衫！

17:22.521 --> 17:24.304
Oh, fantastic!
哦，太棒了！

17:24.391 --> 17:27.348
Now I'm lost in the jungle
with no clothes on.
现在我迷失在丛林里
没穿衣服。

17:27.435 --> 17:28.869
- That's no problem.
- 那没问题。

17:28.956 --> 17:32.217
Remember, you can
imagine anything!
请记住，你可以
想象任何事情！

17:35.608 --> 17:38.130
- Imagine, huh?
- 想象一下吧？

17:38.217 --> 17:40.738
All right.
[grunting]
好的。
[咕噜声]

17:40.825 --> 17:43.478
Oh, not bad.
哦，还不错。

17:43.564 --> 17:45.391
A jungle safari could be fun.
丛林探险可能会很有趣。

17:45.478 --> 17:47.261
- Oh!
- 哦！

17:47.348 --> 17:52.000
And whatever you do,
don't imagine...
而且无论你做什么，
不要想象...

17:52.087 --> 17:54.695
a stampede of sea elephants!
海象的踩踏！

17:54.782 --> 17:55.956
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

17:56.043 --> 17:57.782
[elephant trumpeting]
[大象的喇叭声]

17:57.869 --> 17:59.564
- Thanks a lot!
- 多谢！

17:59.651 --> 18:01.304
- No problem!
- 没问题！

18:01.391 --> 18:03.956
- Now tell me how to escape
from a stampede
- 现在告诉我如何逃脱
来自踩踏事件

18:04.043 --> 18:06.348
of sea elephants!
- Hmm.
海象！
- 唔。

18:06.435 --> 18:09.738
If only you had
a hot air balloon.
如果你有
一个热气球。

18:09.825 --> 18:13.087
- [elephants trumpeting]
- [大象吹号]

18:13.174 --> 18:15.087
- Huh?
- 啊？

18:15.174 --> 18:17.087
- [laughs]
- [笑]

18:25.564 --> 18:26.912
- Huh?
- 啊？

18:31.869 --> 18:33.956
- [laughing]
- [screaming]
- [笑]
- [尖叫]

18:34.043 --> 18:36.521
[screaming continues]
[尖叫声继续]

18:36.608 --> 18:38.521
- I've always wanted
to ride in a balloon.
-我一直想要
乘坐气球。

18:38.608 --> 18:40.782
- Me too!
- 我也是！

18:40.869 --> 18:42.695
Unless there's a tornado.
除非有龙卷风。

18:42.782 --> 18:44.782
- Tornado?
- 龙卷风？

18:44.869 --> 18:46.000
[wind blowing]
[风吹来]

18:46.087 --> 18:49.130
- [laughing]
- [screaming]
- [笑]
- [尖叫]

18:54.304 --> 18:55.912
[screams]
[尖叫声]

18:56.000 --> 18:57.869
- You know what's better
than a tornado?
- 你知道什么是更好的
比龙卷风？

18:57.956 --> 18:59.651
A bubble tornado!
泡沫龙卷风！

18:59.738 --> 19:01.000
- Huh?
- 啊？

19:02.564 --> 19:04.130
Huh?
啊？

19:04.217 --> 19:06.000
Ahh.
啊。

19:09.261 --> 19:10.825
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

19:13.087 --> 19:14.478
- You okay, Squidward?
- 你还好吗，章鱼哥？

19:14.564 --> 19:16.564
- No!
- 不！

19:16.651 --> 19:18.348
- He's okay.
- 他没事。

19:18.435 --> 19:20.738
- Say, are there dinosaurs
in the jungle?
- 说，有恐龙吗
在丛林里？

19:20.825 --> 19:22.087
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

19:22.174 --> 19:24.435
[shrieking, roaring]
[尖叫、咆哮]

19:24.521 --> 19:25.869
[yelling]
[大喊]

19:25.956 --> 19:28.695
I hate imagination!
我讨厌想象力！

19:28.782 --> 19:30.521
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

19:30.608 --> 19:33.217
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

19:36.304 --> 19:38.217
- I'm so happy
Squidward's having
- 我很高兴
章鱼哥有

19:38.304 --> 19:41.087
such an exciting adventure!
如此令人兴奋的冒险！

19:41.174 --> 19:43.564
- How do I get out
of this jungle?
- 我怎么出去
这片丛林的？

19:43.651 --> 19:45.043
- Hmm.
- 唔。

19:45.130 --> 19:49.174
Try imagining
your favorite place!
尝试想象一下
你最喜欢的地方！

19:49.261 --> 19:51.782
- Favorite place?
Um, I've got it!
- 最喜欢的地方？
嗯，我明白了！

19:51.869 --> 19:53.956
A jazz club!
爵士俱乐部！

19:54.043 --> 19:56.608
[soft jazz music playing]
[轻柔的爵士乐演奏]

19:56.695 --> 19:59.738
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:59.825 --> 20:01.738
Ooh, finally.
哦，终于。

20:01.825 --> 20:04.000
A place with culture.
一个有文化的地方。

20:13.000 --> 20:15.435
[sniffs] Ahh.
[吸鼻子] 啊。

20:15.521 --> 20:18.521
Even the coffee
smells like jazz.
就连咖啡
闻起来像爵士乐。

20:18.608 --> 20:19.956
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

20:20.043 --> 20:22.043
Digging that groove.
挖那个沟。

20:22.130 --> 20:24.912
Both:
We dig it!
两者：
我们挖它！

20:25.000 --> 20:28.738
[imitating guitar wailing]
[模仿吉他哀嚎]

20:28.825 --> 20:31.000
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

20:31.087 --> 20:34.435
[disquieting music]
[令人不安的音乐]

20:34.521 --> 20:37.174
Ugh!
This coffee tastes like rocks!
啊!
这咖啡尝起来像石头！

20:37.261 --> 20:38.912
[rock chord plays]
[yelps]
[摇滚和弦演奏]
[尖叫声]

20:39.000 --> 20:40.521
- One, two, three, four!
- 一、二、三、四！

20:40.608 --> 20:42.304
- Punk rock?
- 朋克摇滚？

20:42.391 --> 20:45.348
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

20:45.435 --> 20:49.608
- [screams]
Everything's gone crazy!
- [尖叫]
一切都变得疯狂了！

20:49.695 --> 20:52.738
- Sounds like your
imagination is overheating.
- 听起来像你的
想象力过热。

20:52.825 --> 20:54.087
Try to clear your mind.
试着理清思绪。

20:54.174 --> 20:58.348
- Clear my mind?
Clear my mind!
- 清除我的思绪？
理清我的思绪！

20:58.435 --> 21:00.130
Phew!
唷！

21:00.217 --> 21:01.912
- Where are you now, Squidward?
- 你现在在哪里，章鱼哥？

21:02.000 --> 21:04.825
- I'm in an empty white void.
- 我身处一片白色的虚空之中。

21:04.912 --> 21:07.217
But at least it's peaceful.
但至少是平静的。

21:07.304 --> 21:10.087
- Uh, that sounds like
the Doodle dimension.
- 呃，听起来像是
涂鸦维度。

21:10.174 --> 21:12.564
- Watch out for DoodleBob!
- 小心涂鸦鲍勃！

21:12.651 --> 21:14.043
- What's he look like?
- 他长什么样？

21:14.130 --> 21:17.174
- Um, he looks
kind of like this.
- 嗯，他看起来
有点像这样。

21:20.087 --> 21:21.348
- [gibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

21:21.435 --> 21:22.434
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

21:23.651 --> 21:27.912
[screaming]
[尖叫]

21:28.000 --> 21:30.261
Would somebody please...
[grunts]
有人请...
[咕哝]

21:30.348 --> 21:32.304
Tell me how...
[grunts]
告诉我怎么...
[咕哝]

21:32.391 --> 21:35.000
To get out of this...
[grunts]
为了摆脱这个...
[咕哝]

21:35.087 --> 21:37.087
Stupid box!
[groans]
傻盒子！
[呻吟]

21:37.174 --> 21:38.738
- You want out?
- 你想出去吗？

21:38.825 --> 21:40.651
- Well, why didn't you say so?
- 那么，你为什么不这么说呢？

21:40.738 --> 21:42.782
Just draw an exit door.
只需画一个出口门即可。

21:42.869 --> 21:45.521
- I don't have a pen!
- 我没有笔！

21:45.608 --> 21:48.608
- You're an octopus.
You're full of ink!
- 你是章鱼。
你满身都是墨水！

21:48.695 --> 21:51.478
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

21:51.564 --> 21:54.087
- [gibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

22:00.087 --> 22:03.564
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

22:03.651 --> 22:05.782
Huh? Huh?
啊？啊？

22:05.869 --> 22:07.564
I'm home!
我到家了！

22:07.651 --> 22:09.912
[sobs]
[抽泣]

22:10.000 --> 22:12.261
Hmph.
哼。

22:12.348 --> 22:14.651
Where did SpongeBob
and Patrick run off to?
海绵宝宝去哪儿了
和帕特里克跑去？

22:14.738 --> 22:16.261
Oh, well.
那好吧。

22:16.348 --> 22:20.130
I'm going to the place
where imagination goes to die.
我要去那个地方
想象力将消亡。

22:21.651 --> 22:25.782
My dreary, pointless
minimum wage job.
我的沉闷、毫无意义
最低工资工作。

22:25.869 --> 22:32.130
[inhales] Ah, the good old
boring Krusty Krab.
[吸气]啊，老好人
无聊的蟹堡王。

22:32.217 --> 22:36.043
I'm actually happy to be back.
我真的很高兴能回来。

22:36.130 --> 22:38.869
May I take your order, sir?
先生，我可以接受您的命令吗？

22:38.956 --> 22:40.782
- Should we tell him?
- 我们应该告诉他吗？

22:40.869 --> 22:42.435
- Nah, he sounds so happy.
- 不，他听起来很高兴。

22:42.521 --> 22:47.348
- One Krabby combo coming up!
- 一款蟹蟹组合即将推出！

22:47.435 --> 22:48.434
[sighs]
[叹气]

22:50.217 --> 22:52.695
[mellow island music]
【柔和的岛屿音乐】

22:52.782 --> 22:59.956
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪